  "voice": {
    "comment": "How the Prism answers a gesture in tone and colour, after verdant resonance's soundscape without its garden: 5-limit just intonation over one base, five partials, a loudness ceiling far under the owner's own sounds, and a rest between answers. Answers are PrismResonance's; the page's own outcomes map onto them until the resonance signal arrives.",
